{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>ViuTV《悠長假期》當中AK江𤒹生破格飾演「黃子樂」一角，還原日版竹野內豐飾演的「葉山真二」。首支預告片曝光 …</p><p></p>\n<p>ViuTV《悠長假期》當中AK江𤒹生破格飾演「黃子樂」一角，還原日版竹野內豐飾演的「葉山真二」。首支預告片曝光後，他重現經典動作兼展現瀟灑不羈氣質，令觀眾大呼驚喜。預告中他與飾演音樂系清純學妹「李芷媛」林愷鈴親密互動，瞬間成為焦點。</p>\n<h2>港版《悠長假期》預告江𤒹生重現經典托篋動作</h2>\n<p>劇組日前正式釋出首支絕密預告片，畫面中江𤒹生戴著特製造型演繹原著靈魂，更直接重現日版神級經典「膊頭托篋」霸氣動作。除此之外，片段亦閃過多個充滿電影感唯美場景，包括AK與林愷鈴傾訴心事、與數名知己熱血飲酒聚會等畫面。連串緊湊鏡頭徹底展現出江𤒹生駕馭破格角色功力。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945841060477942_7978961786af72e2ae8569.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"悠長假期 江𤒹生 畫面中江𤒹生戴著特製造型演繹原著靈魂，更直接重現日版神級經典「膊頭托篋」霸氣動作。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945841060477942_7978961786af72e2ae8569.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>畫面中江𤒹生戴著特製造型演繹原著靈魂，更直接重現日版神級經典「膊頭托篋」霸氣動作。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458410817396427_18105149866af72e2c9e023.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"悠長假期 江𤒹生 二人於《繩角》一早有彈琴戲份（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458410817396427_18105149866af72e2c9e023.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>二人於《繩角》一早有彈琴戲份（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411000838449_17347335306af72e2e6637e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"悠長假期 江𤒹生 兩人過往演藝履歷，已是這對螢幕情侶第3度合體碰撞出火花。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411000838449_17347335306af72e2e6637e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>兩人過往演藝履歷，已是這對螢幕情侶第3度合體碰撞出火花。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411075237476_9318597626af72e2f387da.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"悠長假期 江𤒹生 製作特輯預告，包括AK與林愷鈴傾訴心事情節。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411075237476_9318597626af72e2f387da.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>製作特輯預告，包括AK與林愷鈴傾訴心事情節。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>江𤒹生林愷鈴互讚對方呢個優點</h2>\n<p>江𤒹生飾演黃子樂與林愷鈴演繹李芷媛在港版《悠長假期》中有著極多對手戲，兩人更需要一同合奏鋼琴展現音樂火花。面對外界高度關注，雙方透過劇組直言經過早前多次磨合，如今合作起來非常順利，林愷鈴更大讚拍檔：「佢演戲好自然，絕對可以畀100分。」毫不掩飾對男方抱有百分百信任。</p>\n<h2>二人繼《繩角》與《冰上火花》後結緣</h2>\n<p>翻查兩人過往演藝履歷，今次經已是這對螢幕情侶第3度合體碰撞出火花。早於2022年熱播劇《繩角》中，江𤒹生化身熱血拳擊手與飾演鋼琴老師姜秀賢合演情侶，當時首日開工便要挑戰半裸沖涼場面，最終憑藉四手聯彈情節成功俘虜大眾。其後兩人於2023年再度加盟《冰上火花》劇組，男方出任冰球暴風隊隊長王天城，與女主角余悅在拍攝過程中進一步加深了解，為今次再續前緣奠定堅實基礎。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚江𤒹生瀟灑造型十足！</h2>\n<p>港版《悠長假期》預告片段火速在各大討論區洗版，不少網民紛紛留言大讚AK還原度較高，有人直指：「佢個不羈造型真係好有竹野內豐嗰種瀟灑感。」亦有評論認為劇集將為本地電視圈帶來全新衝擊，直言：「連托篋個動作都跟到足，真係睇得出製作團隊同演員好專業。」</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411295231622_14787583336af72e316f4f0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"悠長假期 江𤒹生 兩人亦上過ChillClub合唱《繩角》片尾曲－《我們的相差》（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411295231622_14787583336af72e316f4f0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>兩人亦上過ChillClub合唱《繩角》片尾曲－《我們的相差》<br/>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411466220057_14180383636af72e330069b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"悠長假期 江𤒹生 （圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411466220057_14180383636af72e330069b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411594211463_543870366af72e34e72cb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"悠長假期 江𤒹生 （圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411594211463_543870366af72e34e72cb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411817377609_5533122836af72e3688239.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"悠長假期 江𤒹生 當時首日開工便要挑戰半裸沖涼場面，最終憑藉四手聯彈情節成功俘虜大眾。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179458411817377609_5533122836af72e3688239.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>當時首日開工便要挑戰半裸沖涼場面，最終憑藉四手聯彈情節成功俘虜大眾。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%82%a0%e9%95%b7%e5%81%87%e6%9c%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">悠長假期</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9e%97%e6%84%b7%e9%88%b4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">林愷鈴</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b1%9f%f0%a4%92%b9%e7%94%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">江𤒹生</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：ViuTV資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3542578\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 13 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T17:05:13.428086+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1410,"images":8,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T15:35:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T17:18:41.000882+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T16:58:26.371300+00:00","content_hash":"e4c7b3954b4604556c5142acb5297668fd26f9d18b33aefb39b48c875875ac45","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}